    "title": "Siouxland United earns 2-2 draw with Sioux Falls Thunder FC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Mitchell No media credit provided. ,\n1 hours ago\nSIOUX FALLS, S.D. (KCAU) – Siouxland United FC scored a pair of first half goals on its way to a 2-2 draw against Sioux Falls Thunder FC at USF Stadium-Bob Young Field.\nAbdulmuni Abdalla and Kyohei Eguchi scored in the match for the Outlaws, who move to 3-2-0 on the season.\nSiouxland United returns to action on Saturday at Joy AC.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
